sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Worker (Rank i)
    participant C as Coordinator (Rank 0)
    participant AR as Ring-All-Reduce

    Note over W: Forward & Backward Pass

    W->>W: Snapshot params to<br/>CPU shadow state
    W->>AR: All-Reduce Gradients
    AR-->>W: Reduced Gradients

    C->>W: PREPARE (broadcast)
    activate W
    W->>W: Health check:<br/>gradients finite?<br/>memory OK?
    W-->>C: VOTE (all_gather)<br/>INT8 [1=healthy, 0=fail]
    deactivate W

    alt All votes == 1 (Commit Path)
        C->>W: COMMIT (broadcast)
        activate W
        W->>W: Apply gradients<br/>Optimizer step<br/>Release shadow
        deactivate W
        Note over W: State V_{t+1} ✓
    else Any vote == 0 or timeout (Abort Path)
        C->>W: ABORT (broadcast)
        activate W
        W->>W: Rollback from CPU shadow<br/>Zero out gradients
        deactivate W
        Note over W: State V_t restored ✓<br/>Batch will be retried
    end
